{"ok": true, "summary": "已建立铝合金冷板、六道串联蛇形流道及同侧接口，默认显示流体与上表面温度云图。假设壁厚指上盖厚度，回弯采用半圆，热量全部进入冷却液。采用集总参数与一维经验关联式估算，典型误差约±15–25%，转捩区可能更大；未解析三维导热、局部回流及电芯接触热阻，适用于流量、工质和流道数方案对比，最终需CFD或试验确认。", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>电池冷板热流快速估算</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#263343}\n.row{margin:5px 0}\nh3{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 8px}\nbutton,select{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px;color:#263343}\nbutton:hover,select:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n#buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n#buttons button{padding:4px 6px}\n#gradient{height:9px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#1d4ed8,#06b6d4,#22c55e,#facc15,#dc2626)}\n#scale{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11px}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:15%;right:15%;padding:18px;background:#fff;color:#b00020;z-index:10;text-align:center}\n#help{position:absolute;bottom:10px;right:12px;max-width:480px;padding:9px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#536171;pointer-events:none}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>电池冷板 · 一维热流估算</h3>\n<div class=\"row\">320×180×12 mm · 六道串联 · φ12接口</div>\n<div class=\"row\">流道10×6 mm · 上盖1.5 mm · 热负荷2 kW</div>\n<div class=\"row\">工质 <select id=\"fluid\"><option value=\"glycol\">50%乙二醇</option><option value=\"water\">纯水</option></select>　8 L/min · 25°C</div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"temp\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"hydro\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"transfer\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\">灰：铝合金　蓝：材料视图流道　彩色：温度</div>\n<div class=\"row\"><div id=\"gradient\"></div><div id=\"scale\"></div></div>\n<div id=\"buttons\"><button id=\"mode\">材料视图</button><button id=\"cut\">剖切视图</button><button id=\"rotate\">自动旋转：开</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"help\">工程筛选，不替代CFD：全湿周等效换热、均匀吸热；表面云图为最近流道温度映射，非三维温度场求解。拖动旋转，滚轮缩放。</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script>\nwindow.showError=function(message){const e=document.getElementById('error');e.style.display='block';e.textContent='模型运行错误：'+message;};\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>window.showError(e.message));\nwindow.addEventListener('unhandledrejection',e=>window.showError(e.reason?.message||String(e.reason)));\n</script>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nconst P = {\n  // 尺寸单位mm；流道顶部距上表面1.5，底部余厚4.5\n  L:320,W:180,H:12,n:6,cw:10,ch:6,wall:1.5,\n  pitch:28,endX:130,portD:12,portOuterD:16,portLength:18,\n  straightSegments:40,bendSegments:24,leadSegments:12,\n  // 工况与25°C恒定物性；流量L/min、热负荷W\n  flow:8,Tin:25,heat:2000,fluid:'glycol',\n  fluids:{\n    glycol:{rho:1069,cp:3280,mu:3.4e-3,k:0.38,Pr:29},\n    water:{rho:997,cp:4180,mu:0.89e-3,k:0.607,Pr:6.1}\n  },\n  // 关联式、局部损失系数及铝材参数\n  alK:200,alDensity:2.70,criticalRe:2300,laminarNu:4,\n  dbC:0.023,dbRe:0.8,dbPr:0.4,laminarF:64,blasiusC:0.316,blasiusE:-0.25,\n  bendK:1.5,portK:1.5,mapDecay:20,\n  metalness:0.85,roughness:0.35,fluidOpacity:0.55,\n  colors:{al:'#d4d9e0',fluid:'#3b82f6',stops:['#1d4ed8','#06b6d4','#22c55e','#facc15','#dc2626']}\n};\ntry {\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\n  renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  renderer.localClippingEnabled=true;\n  document.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();\n  scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  scene.environment=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer).fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,0.6));\n  const light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);\n  light.position.set(180,350,220);scene.add(light);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n  const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);\n  controls.enableDamping=true;controls.autoRotate=true;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1.0;\n  const modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\n  const radius=P.pitch/2,z0=-(P.n-1)*P.pitch/2;\n  const yTop=P.H/2,yChannel=yTop-P.wall-P.ch/2;\n  const lead=P.L/2-P.endX,straight=2*P.endX;\n  const pathLength=P.n*straight+(P.n-1)*Math.PI*radius+2*lead;\n  function calculate(){\n    const f=P.fluids[P.fluid],Q=P.flow/60000,A=P.cw*P.ch*1e-6;\n    const perimeter=2*(P.cw+P.ch)/1000,Dh=4*A/perimeter,L=pathLength/1000;\n    const mass=f.rho*Q,rise=P.heat/(mass*f.cp),v=Q/A,Re=f.rho*v*Dh/f.mu;\n    const Nu=Re<P.criticalRe?P.laminarNu:P.dbC*Math.pow(Re,P.dbRe)*Math.pow(f.Pr,P.dbPr);\n    const h=Nu*f.k/Dh,wetArea=perimeter*L,flux=P.heat/wetArea;\n    const wallRise=flux/h+flux*(P.wall/1000)/P.alK;\n    const factor=Re<P.criticalRe?P.laminarF/Re:P.blasiusC*Math.pow(Re,P.blasiusE);\n    const dyn=f.rho*v*v/2,vPort=Q/(Math.PI*(P.portD/1000)**2/4);\n    const friction=factor*L/Dh*dyn,bends=(P.n-1)*P.bendK*dyn;\n    const ports=P.portK*f.rho*vPort*vPort/2,dp=(friction+bends+ports)/1000;\n    const Tout=P.Tin+rise,Tmax=Tout+wallRise,note='以页面实时计算为准';\n    const metrics=[\n      {label:'出口温度',value:Tout.toFixed(2),unit:'°C',note},\n      {label:'最高壁面温度',value:Tmax.toFixed(2),unit:'°C',note},\n      {label:'总压降',value:dp.toFixed(2),unit:'kPa',note},\n      {label:'雷诺数',value:Re.toFixed(0),unit:'',note},\n      {label:'对流换热系数',value:h.toFixed(1),unit:'W/(m²·K)',note},\n      {label:'流路总长',value:L.toFixed(3),unit:'m',note}\n    ];\n    return {metrics,rise,wallRise,Tmax,Tout,Re,h,L,dp,friction,bends,ports};\n  }\n  let result=calculate(),thermal=true,section=false;\n  const parts=[],samples=[];\n  let distance=0;\n  function line(x1,z1,x2,z2,count){\n    const length=Math.hypot(x2-x1,z2-z1);\n    for(let i=0;i<count;i++){\n      const a=i/count,b=(i+1)/count;\n      parts.push({type:'line',x1:x1+(x2-x1)*a,z1:z1+(z2-z1)*a,\n        x2:x1+(x2-x1)*b,z2:z1+(z2-z1)*b,s:distance+length*(i+.5)/count});\n    }\n    distance+=length;\n  }\n  line(-P.L/2,z0,-P.endX,z0,P.leadSegments);\n  for(let i=0;i<P.n;i++){\n    const z=z0+i*P.pitch,right=i%2===0;\n    line(right?-P.endX:P.endX,z,right?P.endX:-P.endX,z,P.straightSegments);\n    if(i<P.n-1){\n      const cx=right?P.endX:-P.endX,cz=z+radius,sign=right?1:-1;\n      for(let j=0;j<P.bendSegments;j++){\n        parts.push({type:'arc',cx,cz,sign,a:j*Math.PI/P.bendSegments,\n          b:(j+1)*Math.PI/P.bendSegments,s:distance+(j+.5)*Math.PI*radius/P.bendSegments});\n      }\n      distance+=Math.PI*radius;\n    }\n  }\n  line(-P.endX,z0+(P.n-1)*P.pitch,-P.L/2,z0+(P.n-1)*P.pitch,P.leadSegments);\n  const metal=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:P.colors.al,metalness:P.metalness,roughness:P.roughness});\n  const fluidMaterial=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0xffffff,metalness:0,roughness:0.6,\n    transparent:true,opacity:P.fluidOpacity,depthWrite:false});\n  const floorY=yTop-P.wall-P.ch;\n  const floor=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(P.L,floorY+P.H/2,P.W),metal);\n  floor.position.y=(-P.H/2+floorY)/2;modelGroup.add(floor);\n  // 槽边界挖孔形成真实肋与外框，不以实心块覆盖流道\n  const outline=[];\n  function pathPoint(part,t){\n    if(part.type==='line')return {x:THREE.MathUtils.lerp(part.x1,part.x2,t),z:THREE.MathUtils.lerp(part.z1,part.z2,t)};\n    const a=THREE.MathUtils.lerp(part.a,part.b,t);\n    return {x:part.cx+part.sign*radius*Math.sin(a),z:part.cz-radius*Math.cos(a)};\n  }\n  parts.forEach(p=>outline.push(pathPoint(p,0)));\n  outline.push(pathPoint(parts[parts.length-1],1));\n  const left=[],right=[];\n  outline.forEach((v,i)=>{\n    const a=outline[Math.max(0,i-1)],b=outline[Math.min(outline.length-1,i+1)];\n    const dx=b.x-a.x,dz=b.z-a.z,len=Math.hypot(dx,dz);\n    left.push(new THREE.Vector2(v.x-dz/len*P.cw/2,-v.z-dx/len*P.cw/2));\n    right.push(new THREE.Vector2(v.x+dz/len*P.cw/2,-v.z+dx/len*P.cw/2));\n  });\n  // 左侧边界微小退让，避免孔路径与外轮廓重合\n  left.forEach(v=>v.x=Math.max(v.x,-P.L/2+.01));\n  right.forEach(v=>v.x=Math.max(v.x,-P.L/2+.01));\n  const shape=new THREE.Shape();\n  shape.moveTo(-P.L/2,-P.W/2);shape.lineTo(P.L/2,-P.W/2);\n  shape.lineTo(P.L/2,P.W/2);shape.lineTo(-P.L/2,P.W/2);shape.closePath();\n  const hole=new THREE.Path(left.concat(right.reverse()));hole.closePath();shape.holes.push(hole);\n  const bodyGeometry=new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(shape,{depth:P.ch,bevelEnabled:false,steps:1});\n  bodyGeometry.rotateX(-Math.PI/2);\n  const body=new THREE.Mesh(bodyGeometry,metal);body.position.y=floorY;modelGroup.add(body);\n  const lid=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(P.L,P.wall,P.W),metal);\n  lid.position.y=yTop-P.wall/2;modelGroup.add(lid);\n  const lineParts=parts.filter(p=>p.type==='line');\n  const instances=new THREE.InstancedMesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(1,P.ch,P.cw),fluidMaterial,lineParts.length);\n  const dummy=new THREE.Object3D();\n  lineParts.forEach((p,i)=>{\n    const dx=p.x2-p.x1,dz=p.z2-p.z1;\n    dummy.position.set((p.x1+p.x2)/2,yChannel,(p.z1+p.z2)/2);\n    dummy.rotation.set(0,-Math.atan2(dz,dx),0);dummy.scale.set(Math.hypot(dx,dz),1,1);\n    dummy.updateMatrix();instances.setMatrixAt(i,dummy.matrix);\n    samples.push({...pathPoint(p,.5),s:p.s,instance:i});\n  });\n  instances.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate=true;instances.computeBoundingSphere();modelGroup.add(instances);\n  const arcs=[];\n  parts.filter(p=>p.type==='arc').forEach(p=>{\n    const g=new THREE.BufferGeometry(),vertices=[],idx=[];\n    [floorY,floorY+P.ch].forEach(y=>{\n      [p.a,p.b].forEach(a=>{\n        [radius-P.cw/2,radius+P.cw/2].forEach(r=>vertices.push(p.cx+p.sign*r*Math.sin(a),y,p.cz-r*Math.cos(a)));\n      });\n    });\n    [[0,2,3,1],[4,5,7,6],[0,1,5,4],[2,6,7,3],[0,4,6,2],[1,3,7,5]].forEach(q=>idx.push(q[0],q[1],q[2],q[0],q[2],q[3]));\n    g.setAttribute('position',new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(vertices,3));g.setIndex(idx);g.computeVertexNormals();\n    const m=fluidMaterial.clone();m.side=THREE.DoubleSide;\n    const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(g,m);modelGroup.add(mesh);arcs.push({mesh,s:p.s});\n    samples.push({...pathPoint(p,.5),s:p.s});\n  });\n  const portShape=new THREE.Shape();portShape.absarc(0,0,P.portOuterD/2,0,Math.PI*2,false);\n  const portHole=new THREE.Path();portHole.absarc(0,0,P.portD/2,0,Math.PI*2,true);portShape.holes.push(portHole);\n  const pg=new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(portShape,{depth:P.portLength,bevelEnabled:false,curveSegments:24});\n  pg.rotateY(-Math.PI/2);\n  [z0,z0+(P.n-1)*P.pitch].forEach(z=>{\n    const port=new THREE.Mesh(pg,metal);port.position.set(-P.L/2,yChannel,z);modelGroup.add(port);\n  });\n  const surfaceGeometry=new THREE.PlaneGeometry(P.L,P.W,64,36);surfaceGeometry.rotateX(-Math.PI/2);\n  const pos=surfaceGeometry.attributes.position,colors=new Float32Array(pos.count*3),mapping=[];\n  for(let i=0;i<pos.count;i++){\n    let nearest=null,min=Infinity;\n    for(const s of samples){const d=Math.hypot(pos.getX(i)-s.x,pos.getZ(i)-s.z);if(d<min){min=d;nearest=s;}}\n    mapping.push({s:nearest.s,weight:Math.exp(-Math.max(0,min-P.cw/2)/P.mapDecay)});\n  }\n  surfaceGeometry.setAttribute('color',new THREE.BufferAttribute(colors,3));\n  const surface=new THREE.Mesh(surfaceGeometry,new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({vertexColors:true,metalness:0,roughness:.6,side:THREE.DoubleSide}));\n  surface.position.y=yTop+.03;modelGroup.add(surface);\n  const stops=P.colors.stops.map(c=>new THREE.Color(c));\n  function tempColor(T){\n    const u=THREE.MathUtils.clamp((T-P.Tin)/(result.Tmax-P.Tin),0,1)*4,i=Math.min(3,Math.floor(u));\n    return stops[i].clone().lerp(stops[i+1],u-i);\n  }\n  function refresh(){\n    result=calculate();window.__metrics=result.metrics;window.__estimate=result;\n    lineParts.forEach((p,i)=>instances.setColorAt(i,thermal?tempColor(P.Tin+result.rise*p.s/pathLength):new THREE.Color(P.colors.fluid)));\n    instances.instanceColor.needsUpdate=true;\n    arcs.forEach(a=>a.mesh.material.color.copy(thermal?tempColor(P.Tin+result.rise*a.s/pathLength):new THREE.Color(P.colors.fluid)));\n    mapping.forEach((m,i)=>tempColor(P.Tin+(result.rise*m.s/pathLength+result.wallRise)*m.weight).toArray(colors,i*3));\n    surfaceGeometry.attributes.color.needsUpdate=true;\n    lid.visible=!section;surface.visible=thermal&&!section;\n    const m=result.metrics;\n    document.getElementById('temp').textContent=`出口 ${m[0].value} °C ｜最高壁温 ${m[1].value} °C`;\n    document.getElementById('hydro').textContent=`总压降 ${m[2].value} kPa ｜Re ${m[3].value}`;\n    document.getElementById('hydro').title=`沿程 ${(result.friction/1000).toFixed(2)} + 回弯 ${(result.bends/1000).toFixed(2)} + 接头 ${(result.ports/1000).toFixed(2)} kPa`;\n    document.getElementById('transfer').textContent=`h ${m[4].value} W/(m²·K) ｜流长 ${m[5].value} m`;\n    document.getElementById('scale').innerHTML=`<span>${P.Tin.toFixed(1)} °C</span><span>${result.Tmax.toFixed(1)} °C</span>`;\n    document.getElementById('mode').textContent=thermal?'材料视图':'温度云图';\n    document.getElementById('cut').textContent=section?'完整视图':'剖切视图';\n  }\n  document.getElementById('fluid').onchange=e=>{P.fluid=e.target.value;refresh();};\n  document.getElementById('mode').onclick=()=>{thermal=!thermal;refresh();};\n  document.getElementById('cut').onclick=()=>{section=!section;refresh();};\n  const rotateButton=document.getElementById('rotate');\n  rotateButton.onclick=()=>{controls.autoRotate=!controls.autoRotate;rotateButton.textContent='自动旋转：'+(controls.autoRotate?'开':'关');};\n  controls.addEventListener('start',()=>{controls.autoRotate=false;rotateButton.textContent='自动旋转：关';});\n  const box=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(modelGroup,true),center=box.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),size=box.getSize(new THREE.Vector3());\n  function fit(){\n    const halfAngle=Math.min(THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(20),Math.atan(Math.tan(THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(20))*camera.aspect));\n    camera.position.copy(center).add(new THREE.Vector3(1,.7,1.2).normalize().multiplyScalar(size.length()/2/Math.sin(halfAngle)/.7));\n    controls.target.copy(center);controls.update();\n  }\n  fit();\n  const grid=new THREE.GridHelper(600,24,0xd6d3ce,0xe8e4dd);grid.position.y=box.min.y-2;scene.add(grid);\n  window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);});\n  window.__scene=scene;window.__camera=camera;window.__renderer=renderer;window.__controls=controls;window.__model=modelGroup;window.__params=P;\n  refresh();\n  renderer.setAnimationLoop(()=>{controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);});\n} catch(error){window.showError(error.message);}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "metrics": [{"label": "出口温度", "value": "29.28", "unit": "°C", "note": "以页面实时计算为准"}, {"label": "最高壁面温度", "value": "90.75", "unit": "°C", "note": "以页面实时计算为准"}, {"label": "总压降", "value": "57.56", "unit": "kPa", "note": "以页面实时计算为准"}, {"label": "雷诺数", "value": "5240", "unit": "", "note": "以页面实时计算为准"}, {"label": "对流换热系数", "value": "571.7", "unit": "W/(m²·K)", "note": "以页面实时计算为准"}, {"label": "流路总长", "value": "1.840", "unit": "m", "note": "以页面实时计算为准"}], "suggestions": ["对比4、8、12 L/min的温度与压降", "改为三支路并联，比较泵功和壁温", "加入电芯接触热阻并制定CFD验证方案"], "raw": "<<<SUMMARY>>>\n已建立铝合金冷板、六道串联蛇形流道及同侧接口，默认显示流体与上表面温度云图。假设壁厚指上盖厚度，回弯采用半圆，热量全部进入冷却液。采用集总参数与一维经验关联式估算，典型误差约±15–25%，转捩区可能更大；未解析三维导热、局部回流及电芯接触热阻，适用于流量、工质和流道数方案对比，最终需CFD或试验确认。\n<<<HTML>>>\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>电池冷板热流快速估算</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#263343}\n.row{margin:5px 0}\nh3{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 8px}\nbutton,select{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px;color:#263343}\nbutton:hover,select:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n#buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n#buttons button{padding:4px 6px}\n#gradient{height:9px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#1d4ed8,#06b6d4,#22c55e,#facc15,#dc2626)}\n#scale{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11px}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:15%;right:15%;padding:18px;background:#fff;color:#b00020;z-index:10;text-align:center}\n#help{position:absolute;bottom:10px;right:12px;max-width:480px;padding:9px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#536171;pointer-events:none}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>电池冷板 · 一维热流估算</h3>\n<div class=\"row\">320×180×12 mm · 六道串联 · φ12接口</div>\n<div class=\"row\">流道10×6 mm · 上盖1.5 mm · 热负荷2 kW</div>\n<div class=\"row\">工质 <select id=\"fluid\"><option value=\"glycol\">50%乙二醇</option><option value=\"water\">纯水</option></select>　8 L/min · 25°C</div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"temp\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"hydro\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"transfer\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\">灰：铝合金　蓝：材料视图流道　彩色：温度</div>\n<div class=\"row\"><div id=\"gradient\"></div><div id=\"scale\"></div></div>\n<div id=\"buttons\"><button id=\"mode\">材料视图</button><button id=\"cut\">剖切视图</button><button id=\"rotate\">自动旋转：开</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"help\">工程筛选，不替代CFD：全湿周等效换热、均匀吸热；表面云图为最近流道温度映射，非三维温度场求解。拖动旋转，滚轮缩放。</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script>\nwindow.showError=function(message){const e=document.getElementById('error');e.style.display='block';e.textContent='模型运行错误：'+message;};\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>window.showError(e.message));\nwindow.addEventListener('unhandledrejection',e=>window.showError(e.reason?.message||String(e.reason)));\n</script>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nconst P = {\n  // 尺寸单位mm；流道顶部距上表面1.5，底部余厚4.5\n  L:320,W:180,H:12,n:6,cw:10,ch:6,wall:1.5,\n  pitch:28,endX:130,portD:12,portOuterD:16,portLength:18,\n  straightSegments:40,bendSegments:24,leadSegments:12,\n  // 工况与25°C恒定物性；流量L/min、热负荷W\n  flow:8,Tin:25,heat:2000,fluid:'glycol',\n  fluids:{\n    glycol:{rho:1069,cp:3280,mu:3.4e-3,k:0.38,Pr:29},\n    water:{rho:997,cp:4180,mu:0.89e-3,k:0.607,Pr:6.1}\n  },\n  // 关联式、局部损失系数及铝材参数\n  alK:200,alDensity:2.70,criticalRe:2300,laminarNu:4,\n  dbC:0.023,dbRe:0.8,dbPr:0.4,laminarF:64,blasiusC:0.316,blasiusE:-0.25,\n  bendK:1.5,portK:1.5,mapDecay:20,\n  metalness:0.85,roughness:0.35,fluidOpacity:0.55,\n  colors:{al:'#d4d9e0',fluid:'#3b82f6',stops:['#1d4ed8','#06b6d4','#22c55e','#facc15','#dc2626']}\n};\ntry {\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\n  renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  renderer.localClippingEnabled=true;\n  document.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();\n  scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  scene.environment=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer).fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,0.6));\n  const light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);\n  light.position.set(180,350,220);scene.add(light);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n  const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);\n  controls.enableDamping=true;controls.autoRotate=true;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1.0;\n  const modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\n  const radius=P.pitch/2,z0=-(P.n-1)*P.pitch/2;\n  const yTop=P.H/2,yChannel=yTop-P.wall-P.ch/2;\n  const lead=P.L/2-P.endX,straight=2*P.endX;\n  const pathLength=P.n*straight+(P.n-1)*Math.PI*radius+2*lead;\n  function calculate(){\n    const f=P.fluids[P.fluid],Q=P.flow/60000,A=P.cw*P.ch*1e-6;\n    const perimeter=2*(P.cw+P.ch)/1000,Dh=4*A/perimeter,L=pathLength/1000;\n    const mass=f.rho*Q,rise=P.heat/(mass*f.cp),v=Q/A,Re=f.rho*v*Dh/f.mu;\n    const Nu=Re<P.criticalRe?P.laminarNu:P.dbC*Math.pow(Re,P.dbRe)*Math.pow(f.Pr,P.dbPr);\n    const h=Nu*f.k/Dh,wetArea=perimeter*L,flux=P.heat/wetArea;\n    const wallRise=flux/h+flux*(P.wall/1000)/P.alK;\n    const factor=Re<P.criticalRe?P.laminarF/Re:P.blasiusC*Math.pow(Re,P.blasiusE);\n    const dyn=f.rho*v*v/2,vPort=Q/(Math.PI*(P.portD/1000)**2/4);\n    const friction=factor*L/Dh*dyn,bends=(P.n-1)*P.bendK*dyn;\n    const ports=P.portK*f.rho*vPort*vPort/2,dp=(friction+bends+ports)/1000;\n    const Tout=P.Tin+rise,Tmax=Tout+wallRise,note='以页面实时计算为准';\n    const metrics=[\n      {label:'出口温度',value:Tout.toFixed(2),unit:'°C',note},\n      {label:'最高壁面温度',value:Tmax.toFixed(2),unit:'°C',note},\n      {label:'总压降',value:dp.toFixed(2),unit:'kPa',note},\n      {label:'雷诺数',value:Re.toFixed(0),unit:'',note},\n      {label:'对流换热系数',value:h.toFixed(1),unit:'W/(m²·K)',note},\n      {label:'流路总长',value:L.toFixed(3),unit:'m',note}\n    ];\n    return {metrics,rise,wallRise,Tmax,Tout,Re,h,L,dp,friction,bends,ports};\n  }\n  let result=calculate(),thermal=true,section=false;\n  const parts=[],samples=[];\n  let distance=0;\n  function line(x1,z1,x2,z2,count){\n    const length=Math.hypot(x2-x1,z2-z1);\n    for(let i=0;i<count;i++){\n      const a=i/count,b=(i+1)/count;\n      parts.push({type:'line',x1:x1+(x2-x1)*a,z1:z1+(z2-z1)*a,\n        x2:x1+(x2-x1)*b,z2:z1+(z2-z1)*b,s:distance+length*(i+.5)/count});\n    }\n    distance+=length;\n  }\n  line(-P.L/2,z0,-P.endX,z0,P.leadSegments);\n  for(let i=0;i<P.n;i++){\n    const z=z0+i*P.pitch,right=i%2===0;\n    line(right?-P.endX:P.endX,z,right?P.endX:-P.endX,z,P.straightSegments);\n    if(i<P.n-1){\n      const cx=right?P.endX:-P.endX,cz=z+radius,sign=right?1:-1;\n      for(let j=0;j<P.bendSegments;j++){\n        parts.push({type:'arc',cx,cz,sign,a:j*Math.PI/P.bendSegments,\n          b:(j+1)*Math.PI/P.bendSegments,s:distance+(j+.5)*Math.PI*radius/P.bendSegments});\n      }\n      distance+=Math.PI*radius;\n    }\n  }\n  line(-P.endX,z0+(P.n-1)*P.pitch,-P.L/2,z0+(P.n-1)*P.pitch,P.leadSegments);\n  const metal=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:P.colors.al,metalness:P.metalness,roughness:P.roughness});\n  const fluidMaterial=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0xffffff,metalness:0,roughness:0.6,\n    transparent:true,opacity:P.fluidOpacity,depthWrite:false});\n  const floorY=yTop-P.wall-P.ch;\n  const floor=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(P.L,floorY+P.H/2,P.W),metal);\n  floor.position.y=(-P.H/2+floorY)/2;modelGroup.add(floor);\n  // 槽边界挖孔形成真实肋与外框，不以实心块覆盖流道\n  const outline=[];\n  function pathPoint(part,t){\n    if(part.type==='line')return {x:THREE.MathUtils.lerp(part.x1,part.x2,t),z:THREE.MathUtils.lerp(part.z1,part.z2,t)};\n    const a=THREE.MathUtils.lerp(part.a,part.b,t);\n    return {x:part.cx+part.sign*radius*Math.sin(a),z:part.cz-radius*Math.cos(a)};\n  }\n  parts.forEach(p=>outline.push(pathPoint(p,0)));\n  outline.push(pathPoint(parts[parts.length-1],1));\n  const left=[],right=[];\n  outline.forEach((v,i)=>{\n    const a=outline[Math.max(0,i-1)],b=outline[Math.min(outline.length-1,i+1)];\n    const dx=b.x-a.x,dz=b.z-a.z,len=Math.hypot(dx,dz);\n    left.push(new THREE.Vector2(v.x-dz/len*P.cw/2,-v.z-dx/len*P.cw/2));\n    right.push(new THREE.Vector2(v.x+dz/len*P.cw/2,-v.z+dx/len*P.cw/2));\n  });\n  // 左侧边界微小退让，避免孔路径与外轮廓重合\n  left.forEach(v=>v.x=Math.max(v.x,-P.L/2+.01));\n  right.forEach(v=>v.x=Math.max(v.x,-P.L/2+.01));\n  const shape=new THREE.Shape();\n  shape.moveTo(-P.L/2,-P.W/2);shape.lineTo(P.L/2,-P.W/2);\n  shape.lineTo(P.L/2,P.W/2);shape.lineTo(-P.L/2,P.W/2);shape.closePath();\n  const hole=new THREE.Path(left.concat(right.reverse()));hole.closePath();shape.holes.push(hole);\n  const bodyGeometry=new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(shape,{depth:P.ch,bevelEnabled:false,steps:1});\n  bodyGeometry.rotateX(-Math.PI/2);\n  const body=new THREE.Mesh(bodyGeometry,metal);body.position.y=floorY;modelGroup.add(body);\n  const lid=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(P.L,P.wall,P.W),metal);\n  lid.position.y=yTop-P.wall/2;modelGroup.add(lid);\n  const lineParts=parts.filter(p=>p.type==='line');\n  const instances=new THREE.InstancedMesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(1,P.ch,P.cw),fluidMaterial,lineParts.length);\n  const dummy=new THREE.Object3D();\n  lineParts.forEach((p,i)=>{\n    const dx=p.x2-p.x1,dz=p.z2-p.z1;\n    dummy.position.set((p.x1+p.x2)/2,yChannel,(p.z1+p.z2)/2);\n    dummy.rotation.set(0,-Math.atan2(dz,dx),0);dummy.scale.set(Math.hypot(dx,dz),1,1);\n    dummy.updateMatrix();instances.setMatrixAt(i,dummy.matrix);\n    samples.push({...pathPoint(p,.5),s:p.s,instance:i});\n  });\n  instances.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate=true;instances.computeBoundingSphere();modelGroup.add(instances);\n  const arcs=[];\n  parts.filter(p=>p.type==='arc').forEach(p=>{\n    const g=new THREE.BufferGeometry(),vertices=[],idx=[];\n    [floorY,floorY+P.ch].forEach(y=>{\n      [p.a,p.b].forEach(a=>{\n        [radius-P.cw/2,radius+P.cw/2].forEach(r=>vertices.push(p.cx+p.sign*r*Math.sin(a),y,p.cz-r*Math.cos(a)));\n      });\n    });\n    [[0,2,3,1],[4,5,7,6],[0,1,5,4],[2,6,7,3],[0,4,6,2],[1,3,7,5]].forEach(q=>idx.push(q[0],q[1],q[2],q[0],q[2],q[3]));\n    g.setAttribute('position',new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(vertices,3));g.setIndex(idx);g.computeVertexNormals();\n    const m=fluidMaterial.clone();m.side=THREE.DoubleSide;\n    const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(g,m);modelGroup.add(mesh);arcs.push({mesh,s:p.s});\n    samples.push({...pathPoint(p,.5),s:p.s});\n  });\n  const portShape=new THREE.Shape();portShape.absarc(0,0,P.portOuterD/2,0,Math.PI*2,false);\n  const portHole=new THREE.Path();portHole.absarc(0,0,P.portD/2,0,Math.PI*2,true);portShape.holes.push(portHole);\n  const pg=new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(portShape,{depth:P.portLength,bevelEnabled:false,curveSegments:24});\n  pg.rotateY(-Math.PI/2);\n  [z0,z0+(P.n-1)*P.pitch].forEach(z=>{\n    const port=new THREE.Mesh(pg,metal);port.position.set(-P.L/2,yChannel,z);modelGroup.add(port);\n  });\n  const surfaceGeometry=new THREE.PlaneGeometry(P.L,P.W,64,36);surfaceGeometry.rotateX(-Math.PI/2);\n  const pos=surfaceGeometry.attributes.position,colors=new Float32Array(pos.count*3),mapping=[];\n  for(let i=0;i<pos.count;i++){\n    let nearest=null,min=Infinity;\n    for(const s of samples){const d=Math.hypot(pos.getX(i)-s.x,pos.getZ(i)-s.z);if(d<min){min=d;nearest=s;}}\n    mapping.push({s:nearest.s,weight:Math.exp(-Math.max(0,min-P.cw/2)/P.mapDecay)});\n  }\n  surfaceGeometry.setAttribute('color',new THREE.BufferAttribute(colors,3));\n  const surface=new THREE.Mesh(surfaceGeometry,new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({vertexColors:true,metalness:0,roughness:.6,side:THREE.DoubleSide}));\n  surface.position.y=yTop+.03;modelGroup.add(surface);\n  const stops=P.colors.stops.map(c=>new THREE.Color(c));\n  function tempColor(T){\n    const u=THREE.MathUtils.clamp((T-P.Tin)/(result.Tmax-P.Tin),0,1)*4,i=Math.min(3,Math.floor(u));\n    return stops[i].clone().lerp(stops[i+1],u-i);\n  }\n  function refresh(){\n    result=calculate();window.__metrics=result.metrics;window.__estimate=result;\n    lineParts.forEach((p,i)=>instances.setColorAt(i,thermal?tempColor(P.Tin+result.rise*p.s/pathLength):new THREE.Color(P.colors.fluid)));\n    instance